            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Consumer sentiment rises to 4-month high, retail stocks drop",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance's <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/john-hyland/\">John Hyland</a> tracks today's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this Market Minute, including retail stocks' reactions to the Supreme Court delaying their decision on President Trump's tariff policies, US consumer sentiment rising to its highest level since September 2025, and TD Cowen analysts forecast Chevron (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CVX\">CVX</a>) could see a $700 million per year boost from Venezuelan oil production (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CL=F\">CL=F</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BZ=F\">BZ=F</a>).</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
